<item><title>Chad&apos;s justice ministry orders prosecutors to stop police custody in civil disputes</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-s-justice-ministry-orders-prosecutors-to-stop-police-a252ea/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-s-justice-ministry-orders-prosecutors-to-stop-police-a252ea/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>A 25 November circular tells prosecutors general to summon judicial police officers and enforce the ban on custody in civil, commercial and social cases.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:31:13 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad declares 28 November a public holiday</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-declares-28-november-a-public-holiday-b79113/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-declares-28-november-a-public-holiday-b79113/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The government says the holiday for the Republic’s proclamation covers public and private workers nationwide, with work resuming on Monday, 30 November.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:57:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>El Chanel to perform in N&apos;Djamena on 30 November to promote « Nagada »</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/el-chanel-to-perform-in-n-djamena-on-30-november-to-promote-ba3177/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/el-chanel-to-perform-in-n-djamena-on-30-november-to-promote-ba3177/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The Cameroonian singer&apos;s 10-track album, released on 31 October, deals with love, social realities and gratitude to God.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:00:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Moyen-Chari trains more than 50 women to protect children&apos;s rights</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/moyen-chari-trains-more-than-50-women-to-protect-children-s-badf54/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/moyen-chari-trains-more-than-50-women-to-protect-children-s-badf54/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The provincial delegation for women and early childhood, with UNICEF support, is addressing child marriage and female genital mutilation in Sarh.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 04:58:36 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Chad opens reception site for Arabs expelled from Niger</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-opens-reception-site-for-arabs-expelled-from-niger-7ac9a2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-opens-reception-site-for-arabs-expelled-from-niger-7ac9a2/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>More than a thousand people from Niger’s Diffa region have crossed the border, while Niamey has given them until 31 December to leave.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:51:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-opens-reception-site-for-arabs-expelled-from-niger-7ac9a2/share.jpg" length="39408" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-opens-reception-site-for-arabs-expelled-from-niger-7ac9a2/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
